01:31.207 --> 01:36.207
The Ties that Bind

01:33.667 --> 01:35.917
This is the Allied Shinobi Forces Jutsu!

01:37.627 --> 01:38.757
How pitiful.

01:40.007 --> 01:40.877
Yeah.

01:42.007 --> 01:45.217
This hope that they're all
clinging to doesn't exist.

01:45.927 --> 01:49.847
Just like their very lives,
at this point.

01:52.347 --> 01:54.347
It seems Ten Tails is ready.

01:54.937 --> 01:57.067
Fifth Gate of Closing! Open!

01:58.777 --> 02:02.947
<i>So this time, they're coming</i>
<i>after us, not Ten Tails...</i>

02:03.487 --> 02:04.487
<i>Well...</i>

02:04.527 --> 02:07.077
<i>Taking the enemy's brains</i>
<i>is a fundamental strategy...</i>

02:07.907 --> 02:09.287
<i>I'll follow the strategy and...</i>

02:09.327 --> 02:12.497
<i>take down those two,</i>
<i>who are the brains of the Ten Tails!</i>

02:13.037 --> 02:14.787
<i>For that to work...</i>

02:15.457 --> 02:17.917
<i>they would need to</i>
<i>stop the Ten Tails first!</i>

02:24.507 --> 02:27.757
What?! I thought we had immobilized
the Ten Tails!

02:28.547 --> 02:30.177
Are you okay?! Damn it...

02:49.987 --> 02:51.737
<i>My shoulder's dislocated...</i>

02:51.987 --> 02:54.037
Look at the Sensing Water Sphere...

02:54.577 --> 02:56.867
It's practically like a small planet.

02:57.207 --> 02:59.207
But that's... impossible!

02:59.997 --> 03:01.837
So we didn't immobilize
Ten Tails, after all?

03:02.047 --> 03:03.837
It merely stopped moving on its own

03:03.877 --> 03:06.127
in order to amass power
and undergo transformation?

03:06.507 --> 03:08.257
How are we going to be able to stop it?

03:08.677 --> 03:10.097
And now we can't target those two either!

03:10.887 --> 03:15.807
But we have to stop that thing
or else it's over for us.

03:18.017 --> 03:19.307
I'm about to pee myself...

03:20.517 --> 03:23.067
Instead of freaking out,
infuse your chakra!

03:23.477 --> 03:26.987
Be ready to move as soon as
we get the plan from HQ!

03:27.317 --> 03:29.907
<i>We must immobilize Ten Tails...</i>

03:30.277 --> 03:34.447
<i>or else we can't go after</i>
<i>the brains that are controlling it...</i>

03:34.867 --> 03:36.747
<i>But how?</i>

03:36.867 --> 03:39.917
<i>Even with the jutsu of my clan</i>
<i>who specialize in immobilizing...</i>

03:39.957 --> 03:43.757
<i>the effect would be miniscule compared</i>
<i>to the amount of chakra expended.</i>

03:45.797 --> 03:46.507
Inoichi!

03:46.627 --> 03:47.837
Link me to Kakashi!

03:47.967 --> 03:48.887
Roger!

03:49.427 --> 03:50.847
<i>Kakashi, it's me!</i>

03:52.137 --> 03:54.057
<i>There's something</i>
<i>I want to confirm</i>

03:54.097 --> 03:56.017
<i>regarding the intel from</i>
<i>the last battle sequence...</i>

04:00.477 --> 04:03.777
It's going to start getting more difficult
to control Ten Tails soon...

04:03.977 --> 04:07.237
Reinforce your bond with it
using Hashirama's cells.

04:08.067 --> 04:12.987
Don't you want to check out
Ten Tails' power in its current state?

04:13.827 --> 04:14.907
First, let's...

04:14.987 --> 04:18.617
Yes, let's show them...

04:20.417 --> 04:21.827
... despair!

04:28.967 --> 04:30.967
<i>Shikaku, I'm going to</i>
<i>let you go for now!</i>

04:31.007 --> 04:32.217
<i>What's the matter?!</i>

04:32.257 --> 04:33.257
This is...

04:33.467 --> 04:34.677
No way!

04:36.847 --> 04:38.307
Lord Shikaku! Lord Inoichi!

04:39.187 --> 04:41.767
<i>My Kamui won't make it in time!</i>

04:42.437 --> 04:43.977
Displace it upwards using
an Earth Style technique.

04:44.017 --> 04:44.977
Right!

04:58.447 --> 04:59.787
That far away?

05:00.457 --> 05:02.787
It's so much greater than
all the previous Tailed Beasts!

05:03.327 --> 05:04.537
What power!

05:05.997 --> 05:08.707
It's wobbly from just that little counter...

05:08.757 --> 05:10.297
Its control isn't perfect yet.

05:10.337 --> 05:11.087
Next!

05:30.527 --> 05:34.027
Unbelievable! Such a far-off city
destroyed in an instant!

05:39.827 --> 05:42.867
It's been acting strange for a while,
it seems to be aiming far away!

05:43.497 --> 05:46.957
So all the cities,
and people are within its range of fire?

05:46.957 --> 05:48.917
Then that means
the evacuated Feudal Lords,

05:48.957 --> 05:50.457
everyone protecting the villages...

05:50.667 --> 05:53.297
plus all the citizens of
each nation aren't safe?

05:53.837 --> 05:58.177
Our shinobi on the battlefield are
fighting to protect everyone else...

05:59.677 --> 06:02.637
Those two are trying to eliminate
our reason for this war.

06:10.857 --> 06:12.317
<i>That's the direction of--!</i>

06:15.447 --> 06:16.237
Th-This is...

06:16.777 --> 06:17.947
What's wrong, Lord Ao?!

06:20.487 --> 06:21.867
Please listen to me calmly.

06:28.627 --> 06:29.707
Here, eh?

06:31.337 --> 06:32.967
Well, Shikaku... What do we do?

06:33.467 --> 06:35.797
Just keep doing what we must do.

06:36.927 --> 06:37.967
It will be our last act.

06:38.007 --> 06:39.967
Put me through to
everyone on the battlefield.

06:40.887 --> 06:42.927
I have a plan to stop the Ten Tails!

07:22.847 --> 07:24.597
Finally got them.

07:25.057 --> 07:27.847
We've now smashed
the brains of the Allied Forces.

07:28.187 --> 07:29.857
Like I said before,
it's fundamental strategy.

07:33.477 --> 07:34.437
Shikamaru...

07:34.937 --> 07:36.607
We're in the middle of a war.

07:37.277 --> 07:38.857
Don't waste any words on me.

07:40.617 --> 07:41.487
Or on Ino.

07:44.697 --> 07:48.167
Like Dad said, we just have
to do what we have to do.

07:58.507 --> 08:01.347
Wait... What exactly just happened?!

08:02.427 --> 08:04.467
You are the key to our plan.

08:04.637 --> 08:05.427
Not about that!

08:06.057 --> 08:09.017
I'm asking what happened to
Shikaku and Inoichi?!

08:14.857 --> 08:16.647
Neji! Rotate clockwise!

08:16.737 --> 08:17.607
Got it!

08:17.647 --> 08:19.317
- Eight Trigrams Palm Rotation!
- Eight Trigrams Palm Rotation!

08:19.947 --> 08:21.197
A-Amazing...

08:23.867 --> 08:25.287
Don't just stand there
spacing out, Naruto!

08:25.787 --> 08:27.827
This is a battlefield
and we're in a war.

08:29.207 --> 08:30.077
People will die!

08:31.207 --> 08:33.747
But if we are defeated
and lose this war...

08:33.837 --> 08:35.837
everyone will die!

08:36.797 --> 08:38.757
Of course I know that!

08:39.547 --> 08:43.097
Shikamaru and Ino's father
would likely say, that as shinobi,

08:43.257 --> 08:45.387
they're glad to have died
before their children.

08:45.847 --> 08:47.767
Just as my father did.

08:50.937 --> 08:54.267
Naruto, your power is critical
to the plan.

08:54.817 --> 08:56.857
So until we execute it...

08:56.977 --> 08:58.687
We must protect you, Naruto!

08:59.277 --> 09:00.027
Hinata!

09:01.407 --> 09:02.357
Know this!

09:02.817 --> 09:04.907
The Hyuga are the mightiest
among the Hidden Leaf!

09:05.527 --> 09:08.617
There he goes...
I was hoping to take them down

09:08.657 --> 09:10.657
before they started
with the speeches, but...

09:11.077 --> 09:13.667
It's hard to control Ten Tails well.

09:14.877 --> 09:18.047
This ought to do until
the next transformation, but...

09:18.797 --> 09:20.297
Afterwards...

09:20.337 --> 09:24.177
I suspect only a Jinchuriki will
be able to control it.

09:25.637 --> 09:28.347
Though for me to become
the Ten Tails' Jinchuriki...

09:28.717 --> 09:31.727
I'll need to be fully alive,

09:32.017 --> 09:35.437
not hosted within a corpse
as a Reanimation.

09:35.817 --> 09:38.687
Reanimations like you are perfect
for large-scale suicidal attacks.

09:38.977 --> 09:40.777
But the reason
you haven't launched

09:40.817 --> 09:44.447
the Ten Tails Tailed Beast Bomb
at them, blowing yourself up as well,

09:44.697 --> 09:47.947
is because I'd get caught up
in it and die too.

09:48.987 --> 09:51.787
And the reason that
would be a problem,

09:52.367 --> 09:54.707
is because in order for you to
truly be brought back to life

09:54.747 --> 09:56.537
and become a Jinchuriki...

09:56.837 --> 09:58.797
you need me to sacrifice myself

09:58.837 --> 10:02.047
and perform the Gedo Art of
Rinne Rebirth on you.

10:03.007 --> 10:05.887
In short, you're in
a delicate position right now

10:05.927 --> 10:08.967
where you're entirely at my mercy.

10:09.427 --> 10:10.887
Don't forget that.

10:11.517 --> 10:15.097
Well, well, that rug rat sure
has become the wily fox.

10:15.977 --> 10:18.977
I never considered you a friend.

10:20.897 --> 10:22.027
Fine then.

10:22.897 --> 10:25.907
You decide our next move then.

10:26.697 --> 10:27.617
We continue.

10:28.367 --> 10:32.617
They will know despair... thoroughly.

10:37.037 --> 10:37.877
Wood Style!

10:37.957 --> 10:39.337
Cutting Sprigs!

10:40.047 --> 10:40.957
There's so many of them!

10:41.007 --> 10:42.047
Just try to evade them.

10:42.047 --> 10:44.217
<i>My Mountain Jutsu should</i>
<i>at least slow it down</i>

10:44.257 --> 10:46.887
<i>until Nine Tails' strength returns.</i>

10:47.337 --> 10:49.347
<i>Except I need some time</i>
<i>to build up enough chakra!</i>

10:49.507 --> 10:50.507
<i>Hold on, everybody!</i>

10:51.467 --> 10:53.177
Shannaro!

10:55.187 --> 10:56.307
So many!

10:56.727 --> 10:58.227
My Rotation can't keep up!

11:02.857 --> 11:03.897
Thanks, Neji!

11:03.937 --> 11:05.987
I can activate Sage Mode now!

11:05.987 --> 11:08.317
I can't keep relying on you geniuses!

11:08.447 --> 11:09.827
Now it's my turn!

11:10.447 --> 11:11.947
<i>Rasen Shuriken!</i>

11:17.457 --> 11:18.917
Here's a few more!

11:30.927 --> 11:33.717
<i>Eight Trigrams: Air Wall Palm!</i>

11:37.017 --> 11:38.767
<i>Damn it! A focused attack!</i>

11:38.977 --> 11:40.017
There's too many!

11:40.147 --> 11:41.857
Hinata and Neji's Air Palms
won't be sufficient...

11:41.897 --> 11:42.977
Byakugan!

11:55.747 --> 11:58.037
Earth Style! Mountain Jutsu!

12:01.337 --> 12:02.497
Medical Team!

12:02.837 --> 12:04.797
Where are you?!
There's a critical injury here!

12:05.007 --> 12:06.217
Hurry!

12:08.547 --> 12:09.587
No...

12:10.547 --> 12:12.467
I'm no longer...

12:14.057 --> 12:14.967
Neji...

12:15.677 --> 12:16.427
Brother...

12:20.897 --> 12:22.187
Naruto...

12:24.527 --> 12:26.987
Lady Hinata...

12:27.027 --> 12:30.027
is willing to die for you.

12:32.407 --> 12:36.157
So... you hold more...

12:36.997 --> 12:40.037
than one... life in your hands...

12:43.837 --> 12:49.837
And it seems... that my life too...
may have been...

12:50.967 --> 12:52.847
one of them....

12:54.967 --> 12:58.307
Why? Why did you do this here?

13:00.057 --> 13:01.937
You were going to change
the Hyuga!

13:04.147 --> 13:11.447
<i>Long ago, those words of yours,</i>
<i>freed me from the shackles of fate.</i>

13:15.237 --> 13:18.037
Why would you go so far for me?

13:18.907 --> 13:21.747
Even give up your life...

13:23.247 --> 13:28.587
Because... you called me a genius...

13:31.377 --> 13:35.177
<i>Unlike me, you're not a failure!</i>

13:37.307 --> 13:38.467
<i>Father...</i>

13:38.517 --> 13:43.147
<i>I finally understand...</i>
<i>the freedom you felt...</i>

13:43.977 --> 13:47.017
<i>choosing to die in order</i>
<i>to protect your comrades.</i>

13:55.907 --> 13:58.447
Didn't you say you wouldn't
let your friends die...?

13:59.327 --> 14:00.367
Naruto!

14:07.837 --> 14:10.877
<i>I'll never let my comrades die!</i>

14:21.267 --> 14:26.607
Those words...
"I'll never let my comrades die."

14:27.857 --> 14:32.487
Now look around you...
and say it again!

14:45.617 --> 14:48.457
I told you to say it again!

14:50.797 --> 14:53.257
As the bodies of your comrades
grow cold in your arms...

14:53.297 --> 14:55.717
take in their deaths!

14:58.677 --> 15:01.467
Neji's... dead?!

15:05.267 --> 15:07.017
<i>Hizashi, forgive me...</i>

15:07.857 --> 15:08.807
<i>I let Neji--!</i>

15:09.817 --> 15:12.027
This will continue...

15:12.647 --> 15:16.447
And your flippant words and
ideology shall become lies.

15:17.607 --> 15:20.367
This is the end result of
hope and ideals.

15:20.867 --> 15:22.617
This is reality!

15:23.827 --> 15:24.827
Naruto...

15:25.457 --> 15:27.457
What is there for you in this reality?

15:27.997 --> 15:30.837
Your mother and father are gone,
as well as your master, Jiraiya.

15:30.877 --> 15:33.547
And if you keep standing against us,

15:33.797 --> 15:37.087
you'll continue to lose
your friends one by one.

15:38.717 --> 15:40.177
This shall become a world

15:40.217 --> 15:42.757
where no one who
acknowledges you will exist.

15:44.977 --> 15:45.977
Obito...

15:47.267 --> 15:49.477
The only thing that awaits you...

15:49.937 --> 15:53.857
is your worst nightmare,
which you know quite well!

15:57.947 --> 15:58.857
Solitude!

16:07.207 --> 16:10.827
<i>You've become exactly</i>
<i>like the old me, Obito.</i>

16:11.627 --> 16:13.707
<i>Naruto will give up shortly...</i>

16:13.837 --> 16:16.627
<i>Which will break the will</i>
<i>of the Allied Forces.</i>

16:16.837 --> 16:19.087
Why must you cling to reality?

16:20.547 --> 16:22.967
Enough of this...
Now come join us, Naruto!

16:37.987 --> 16:39.987
Brother Neji just said,

16:40.487 --> 16:43.907
that you hold more than
one life in your hands.

16:43.947 --> 16:46.157
Do you know what he meant?

16:50.207 --> 16:51.827
"I'll never let my comrades die."

16:53.127 --> 16:57.087
Neither those words nor
the conviction behind them are lies!

16:58.507 --> 17:00.627
Because he was able to successfully
store them in his heart,

17:00.717 --> 17:02.337
and live them out to until the end!

17:02.757 --> 17:03.967
Brother Neji did!

17:08.057 --> 17:09.887
It's not just you, Naruto...

17:10.057 --> 17:14.857
We all hold those words
and feelings in our hearts.

17:14.977 --> 17:17.647
They're what bind our lives together...

17:19.187 --> 17:20.947
and make us comrades.

17:23.197 --> 17:27.737
If we all give up and
discard those words and feelings,

17:28.537 --> 17:31.037
Neji's final act will have been
for nothing.

17:32.077 --> 17:35.997
And that is when...
your comrades truly die!

17:36.837 --> 17:38.547
For you are then
no longer comrades.

17:39.877 --> 17:41.127
That's... how I feel.

17:45.677 --> 17:50.347
So, stand with me, Naruto.

17:51.807 --> 17:54.767
Because never going back
on one's word...

17:55.017 --> 17:57.817
is my Ninja Way too!

18:00.527 --> 18:02.067
<i>Naruto...</i>

18:02.107 --> 18:06.777
<i>Lady Hinata...</i>
<i>is willing to die for you.</i>

18:07.697 --> 18:10.787
<i>So... you hold more...</i>

18:10.947 --> 18:12.827
... than one life!

18:13.117 --> 18:15.497
Don't forget about me!

18:15.537 --> 18:16.627
I know.

18:16.837 --> 18:18.337
I take my bonds seriously!

18:18.337 --> 18:20.837
I'd never abandon my comrades!

18:21.257 --> 18:23.967
But in reality, Neji is...

18:24.127 --> 18:26.387
Stop your rambling!

18:26.887 --> 18:30.557
I'll beat you up and take over
your body for good this time!

18:30.967 --> 18:32.887
And did you also forget?

18:33.017 --> 18:36.687
Your mother and father did
the same thing Neji did

18:36.727 --> 18:37.857
just after you were born.

18:38.107 --> 18:40.977
They sealed me,
their archenemy inside you,

18:41.027 --> 18:42.937
and entrusted the future
to you and died.

18:45.317 --> 18:50.367
Your life was already linked to
two others from the time you were born!

18:52.907 --> 18:55.867
<i>Will he just stand back and</i>
<i>see how Naruto responds...?</i>

18:57.747 --> 18:59.707
<i>It seems Naruto makes him uneasy.</i>

19:01.707 --> 19:02.587
Enough!

19:05.547 --> 19:06.797
Don't be hasty!

19:06.967 --> 19:09.347
You're going to harm yourself
as well as Ten Tails!

19:09.387 --> 19:10.507
I don't care!

19:10.967 --> 19:12.467
Ten Tails hide is tough!

19:15.977 --> 19:16.977
They're going to hit us!

19:18.187 --> 19:19.857
Recharging completed!

19:20.317 --> 19:21.647
<i>Be careful, Lord Bee!</i>

19:21.857 --> 19:22.977
Go get 'em!

19:28.697 --> 19:30.027
Take this!

19:46.007 --> 19:46.967
Lord Bee!

19:46.967 --> 19:48.507
Don't go overboard!

19:49.007 --> 19:50.757
There's no need to worry...

19:50.797 --> 19:53.347
Protecting the Alliance is my territory!

20:04.477 --> 20:05.987
<i>That's right.</i>

20:06.027 --> 20:08.157
<i>It wasn't just Mom and Dad.</i>

20:09.357 --> 20:10.817
<i>Yeah...</i>

20:10.867 --> 20:13.827
<i>It hasn't just been my life...</i>

20:14.447 --> 20:15.867
<i>up until now.</i>

20:25.957 --> 20:28.507
Thanks, Hinata!

20:29.587 --> 20:32.297
It's all thanks to you
standing by my side.

20:35.057 --> 20:36.267
And Neji...

20:37.347 --> 20:39.097
Thank you.

20:46.647 --> 20:50.067
<i>Naruto's hand is so big...</i>

20:50.107 --> 20:52.907
<i>and strong, but most of all...</i>

20:56.197 --> 20:57.907
